#====================================================================
# Draft knowledge entry - node crashes on OHOS; restore original entry via
# --jitless (E400), python comparator only as supplemental evidence
# Source package: libmysofa/1.3.5
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-libmysofa-1.3.5-node-crashes-on-ohos-use-equivalent-comparator
trigger_tool:           node|ctest|sh|python
phase:                  testing|verification
error_signature:        Check failed.*__errno_location|Signal 5|core dumped.*node|Fatal error in , line 0

severity:               2
category:               ohos, testing, node-runtime, test-infrastructure
match_keywords:         node, V8, Signal 5, errno, ctest, compare.sh, json-diff, musl, jitless, comparator, OHOS
title:                  node 在 OHOS 启动即崩：原入口以 NODE_OPTIONS=--jitless 恢复原生通过，python 等价比对器仅作补充证据

root_cause:             On the OHOS armv8 image node/V8 crashes before any
                        script runs: `Fatal error in , line 0, Check failed:
                        12 == (*__errno_location())`, Signal 5, core dump
                        (same runtime failure as E400). Upstream test suites
                        that drive json/text comparison through node (e.g.
                        libmysofa compare.sh -> json-diff.js) therefore fail at
                        the comparator step even though the tested tool output
                        is correct; this is a test-infrastructure defect, not a
                        library defect.
affected_scope:         Any third-party library whose upstream ctest/shell
                        tests depend on node-driven comparators and is adapted
                        to OHOS; the failing tests cannot distinguish library
                        regressions from comparator crashes.
verification_cmd:       NODE_OPTIONS=--jitless ctest -R '^(compare entries)$' --output-on-failure
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           jitless-original-entry-restore
rec_description:        Do not patch the library to satisfy a crashed comparator.
                        R02 实测：node 普通模式崩溃，但 `NODE_OPTIONS=--jitless`
                        （E400 记录的恢复条件，`node --jitless -e 'console.log(1)'`
                        可正常运行）下，以**原始上游 ctest 注册入口**重跑 16 项
                        compare/compareIgnoreNew 用例全部原生通过（16/16 Passed，
                        CTEST_EXIT=0，日志 SHA-256
                        487281faf05275a7a43ff8dfca43fcce64d5a544d1cfce8292e95a15cd1d117a）——
                        不改脚本、不改库，仅恢复 node 运行时。python 等价比对器
                        （容差 0.05，复刻 compare.sh/compareIgnoreNew.sh 语义）仅
                        保留为 R01 补充证据，**不计入原始通过**。
rec_command:            NODE_OPTIONS=--jitless ctest --output-on-failure
rec_auto_fix:           true
rec_impl:               runtime-flag

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      equivalent-comparator-substitution
fallback_description:   Only when no usable node runtime exists at all (both
                        plain and --jitless fail), substitute a python
                        equivalent comparator (same tolerance/ignore-new
                        semantics) and record per-case EQUAL evidence as
                        supplemental validation, marked clearly as non-original;
                        the affected upstream entries must still be recorded
                        with their original command/exit/first error/owner and
                        executable recovery condition.
fallback_command:       python3 tests/pyjsoncmp.py out.json ref.json [--ignore-rhs-new]
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          test-infrastructure-substitution

prescan_pattern:        json-diff|node.*compare|compare\.sh